# Ignore everything on scratch by default, except the provided examples
/*
!.gitignore

!nested-subdir/
!subdir/
!scratch-simulator.cc
!CMakeLists.txt

# The validation harness is NOT scratch work. `/*` above matches this directory,
# and because git does not descend into an ignored directory, every new file
# under it was silently untracked -- verify_causal_sim.py itself needed `git add
# -f`. A validation harness that can quietly not exist is a worse failure mode
# than anything it checks for, so the directory is un-ignored wholesale rather
# than file by file, and verify_causal_sim.py fails if anything under it is
# untracked.
!python_handoff/

# The CA-TBL scenario sources, by pattern rather than by name. The un-ignoring
# above rescued the files that existed when it was written, but `/*` still
# matched anything added afterwards -- verified: a new scratch/ca_tbl_*.cc was
# still reported ignored by `git check-ignore`. Grandfathering the current set
# leaves exactly the trap it was meant to close, one file later.
# All scratch sources, by extension. !ca_tbl_*.cc alone left the same hole one
# filename over -- scale_sweep_simulation.cc is the case in point, and there are
# 35 .cc and 85 .py here. ns-3 compiles every file in scratch/, so a broken one
# would already have blocked the tree; they are 0.46 MB in total. Ship the
# generators, exclude their output: scale_sweep_simulation.cc is the reproducible
# part and the 1.2 GB of physics_scale_sweep_*.csv it writes is not.
!*.cc
!*.py

# ...except the two that #include "ns3/lorawan-module.h". src/lorawan is a nested
# third-party git repository with zero files tracked here, so shipping these two
# gives a clone a scratch directory it cannot compile -- and ns-3 builds every file
# in scratch/, so two unbuildable files block the whole tree including
# ca_tbl_causal_sim. No CA-TBL source references lorawan-module.h; these are
# pre-CA-TBL experiments. Caught by the clone test, which is the only check that
# compiles what a clone actually contains.
lora-combining.cc
lora-dataset.cc
